{"3255660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Requiem For a Lost World", "steam_appid": 3255660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/67b88f929783b366ae57529c77c0278b.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/67b88f929783b366ae57529c77c0278b.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requiem For a Lost World is a survival roguelike where you don't attack directly, but build a system that fights for you. Your weapons fire automatically. Your job is to move, survive, and make the right decisions every time you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs play out the same. Every choice you make: <i>which weapons to pick?</i> <i>which elements to combine?</i> <i>which items to sacrifice HP for?</i> Shapes a build that either holds together under pressure or falls apart when the waves stop giving you room to breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or bring up to 7 others along for the run!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Fight off hordes of enemies</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/bb2a274cec301ad7699b82eab34253dc.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/bb2a274cec301ad7699b82eab34253dc.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kill enemies, collect EXP, level up, choose what your build becomes and attempt to survive for 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite enemies drop special rewards if you manage to defeat them. Monster density and strength ramp continuously as the game progresses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the best build can fail if played incorrectly - Learn and adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Many</strong></i> <i><strong>characters with distinct abilities</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/337fc22c9f511570138dcef56dcf72a5.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/337fc22c9f511570138dcef56dcf72a5.webp?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the growing cast of over 25 unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character comes with a passive ability, a locked starting weapon, an active skill, and Shard upgrades that let you rank them up over time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some scale with enemy count. Some reward risky HP trading. Some revolve entirely around elemental reactions. Your character choice defines the shape of your build before the run even starts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Build Your System</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast selection of upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack your loadout over the course of a run. Each level-up offers a randomized selection of new weapons, upgrades, or passive items to choose from a vast inventory of 100+ weapons and items. Every weapon follows and archetype and deals element-aligned damage making selecting right combinations more important than ever!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elemental Reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a build focusing on multiple elements: hit an enemy with two different elements and a powerful reaction triggers unleashing even more devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do the opposite: stack the same element repeatedly to trigger a different type of effect!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Experience the stylized world</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the vast frozen tundra of corrupted Northern Plains...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/14d9d42c496c25d40f3e19cb0bb98b4d.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/14d9d42c496c25d40f3e19cb0bb98b4d.webp?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=439 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grass fields of the outskirts of the Capital...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/f4b9369e9a7369b506c59753cddf23fa.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/f4b9369e9a7369b506c59753cddf23fa.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into it's darkest dungeons...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/396f1c8891174757ebb21f606d67d01e.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/396f1c8891174757ebb21f606d67d01e.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally face the dangers and the past of the Forbidden Zone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/87175c18d6592a6a4b3ef9bff367a628.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/87175c18d6592a6a4b3ef9bff367a628.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful VFX and the mix of 2D and 3D graphics will make sure to keep you visually entertained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is filled with puzzles and points of interest for you to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Multiple progression systems</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/5fde28a0d330cc99a4635db965bd3fab.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/5fde28a0d330cc99a4635db965bd3fab.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip characters with relics, acquire their rank-ups when weapons alone are no longer enough and unlock buffs from global passive tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character benefits from different stats, and it's up to you to find the perfect balance or define your own META build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly 40 upgradable stats there is plenty to choose from!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Plan your builds ahead of time</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/98da2ca8eb5b6347a28f700f617d997a.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/98da2ca8eb5b6347a28f700f617d997a.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the randomness in your builds? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize them with a built-in planner and compete in leaderboards for the high score!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Play with others</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/6c0648debb9a7b45008eba66811d3429.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/6c0648debb9a7b45008eba66811d3429.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game supports online co-op for up to 8 players. Every player builds their own loadout independently, which means eight different builds sharing the same arena for extra chaos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add a team building to the mix: reaction-focused characters stack well with others running elemental weapons. Survivability roles free up more aggressive players to take risks. Possibilities are endless-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you are a streamer, believing that your chat won't make the gameplay a living hell? With Twitch integration, you can let the chat control your fate!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>In a world scarred by a forgotten era, only one sanctuary remains.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/18bac83ca25162b6908a6a1f1f604aa1.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/18bac83ca25162b6908a6a1f1f604aa1.webp?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the chaos lies a deeper narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Nishi, a man trapped in an endless loop, reliving the same tragedy over and over again in a desperate attempt to save the one he loves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unforgettable characters whose fates intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the truth of a world that has already ended… more than once.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Key features</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of 2D and 3D stylized graphics with various customizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters with individual skills and upgrades that synergize with different builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements and elemental reactions bring more depth into your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic, passive tree and rank-up system brings build customization outside of battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CO-OP mode to play with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waifus I guess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant improvements based on player feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All that and more for literally free!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Note from the developer</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making a game with a story and scope as ambitious as <i>Requiem for the Lost World</i> was a long-running child's dream of mine. I finally decided to bring my idea closer to reality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you will enjoy playing my game as much as I enjoy providing new and fresh content to all of you!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/67b88f929783b366ae57529c77c0278b.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/67b88f929783b366ae57529c77c0278b.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requiem For a Lost World is a survival roguelike where you don't attack directly, but build a system that fights for you. Your weapons fire automatically. Your job is to move, survive, and make the right decisions every time you level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs play out the same. Every choice you make: <i>which weapons to pick?</i> <i>which elements to combine?</i> <i>which items to sacrifice HP for?</i> Shapes a build that either holds together under pressure or falls apart when the waves stop giving you room to breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or bring up to 7 others along for the run!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Fight off hordes of enemies</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/bb2a274cec301ad7699b82eab34253dc.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/bb2a274cec301ad7699b82eab34253dc.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kill enemies, collect EXP, level up, choose what your build becomes and attempt to survive for 30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite enemies drop special rewards if you manage to defeat them. Monster density and strength ramp continuously as the game progresses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the best build can fail if played incorrectly - Learn and adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Many</strong></i> <i><strong>characters with distinct abilities</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/337fc22c9f511570138dcef56dcf72a5.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/337fc22c9f511570138dcef56dcf72a5.webp?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the growing cast of over 25 unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character comes with a passive ability, a locked starting weapon, an active skill, and Shard upgrades that let you rank them up over time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some scale with enemy count. Some reward risky HP trading. Some revolve entirely around elemental reactions. Your character choice defines the shape of your build before the run even starts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Build Your System</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast selection of upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack your loadout over the course of a run. Each level-up offers a randomized selection of new weapons, upgrades, or passive items to choose from a vast inventory of 100+ weapons and items. Every weapon follows and archetype and deals element-aligned damage making selecting right combinations more important than ever!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elemental Reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a build focusing on multiple elements: hit an enemy with two different elements and a powerful reaction triggers unleashing even more devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do the opposite: stack the same element repeatedly to trigger a different type of effect!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Experience the stylized world</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the vast frozen tundra of corrupted Northern Plains...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/14d9d42c496c25d40f3e19cb0bb98b4d.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/14d9d42c496c25d40f3e19cb0bb98b4d.webp?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=439 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grass fields of the outskirts of the Capital...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/f4b9369e9a7369b506c59753cddf23fa.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/f4b9369e9a7369b506c59753cddf23fa.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep into it's darkest dungeons...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/396f1c8891174757ebb21f606d67d01e.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/396f1c8891174757ebb21f606d67d01e.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally face the dangers and the past of the Forbidden Zone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/87175c18d6592a6a4b3ef9bff367a628.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/87175c18d6592a6a4b3ef9bff367a628.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful VFX and the mix of 2D and 3D graphics will make sure to keep you visually entertained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is filled with puzzles and points of interest for you to discover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Multiple progression systems</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/5fde28a0d330cc99a4635db965bd3fab.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/5fde28a0d330cc99a4635db965bd3fab.avif?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap