endless-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you are a streamer, believing that your chat won't make the gameplay a living hell? With Twitch integration, you can let the chat control your fate!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>In a world scarred by a forgotten era, only one sanctuary remains.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras/18bac83ca25162b6908a6a1f1f604aa1.avif?t=1787428446\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/extras_big/18bac83ca25162b6908a6a1f1f604aa1.webp?t=1787428446 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the chaos lies a deeper narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Nishi, a man trapped in an endless loop, reliving the same tragedy over and over again in a desperate attempt to save the one he loves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet unforgettable characters whose fates intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the truth of a world that has already ended… more than once.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Key features</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of 2D and 3D stylized graphics with various customizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters with individual skills and upgrades that synergize with different builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements and elemental reactions bring more depth into your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic, passive tree and rank-up system brings build customization outside of battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CO-OP mode to play with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waifus I guess</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant improvements based on player feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All that and more for literally free!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Note from the developer</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making a game with a story and scope as ambitious as <i>Requiem for the Lost World</i> was a long-running child's dream of mine. I finally decided to bring my idea closer to reality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you will enjoy playing my game as much as I enjoy providing new and fresh content to all of you!</p>", "short_description": "A survival roguelike where your weapons fight for you. Survive 30 minutes against endless enemy waves by crafting builds from weapons, items, and elemental reactions. Play solo or with up to 8 players. Every run is an opportunity, every decision is crucial.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/498c7749258e1a475162f1f39c24456de04b50d6/header.jpg?t=1787428446", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/a4eea6302eec79d17dc89a9f5fd2e1f1dbebf28b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787428446", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/a4eea6302eec79d17dc89a9f5fd2e1f1dbebf28b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787428446", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5/AMD Ryzen or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i5/AMD Ryzen or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Max settings may make your PC go *brrrr*</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 2026 TheNishishiro. All rights reserved. This game is provided free of charge. Any unauthorized commercial use is prohibited.", "developers": ["TheNishishiro"], "publishers": ["TheNishishiro"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 25, "description": "Steam Leaderboards"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/cf9ff8cc5c705aac0afbd07f3df58811964ad78b/ss_cf9ff8cc5c705aac0afbd07f3df58811964ad78b.600x338.jpg?t=1787428446", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255660/cf9ff8cc5c705aac0afbd07f3df58811964ad78b/ss_cf9ff8cc5c705aac0afbd07f3df58811964ad78b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787428446"}, {"id": 1,